{"summary":"A Fantasy Treasure Hunt set in a Retro Pixel Exploration RPG Adventure Game.","description":"** Remastered version **\nSurvival RPG 3: Lost in Time 2D is the third offline adventure game in the retro treasure hunt Survival RPG Adventure series. It's a free offline RPG adventure in a fantasy pixel world. You are lost and teleport through medieval time. To survive and escape, explore fantasy worlds (dungeons, medieval castles, fortresses), craft and find hidden objects and treasures. For protection, mine and craft tools. It's a survival exploration adventure game with quests, in a fantasy RPG retro pixel world.\n\nIn the first games, your quest was to find lost treasures, became a forager and crafting expert. Now to escape in this free offline 2D retro RPG (role-playing games), explore:\n- 7 story chapters in 3 timelines: Medieval, Jurassic, Future\n- Fight dragons, dinosaurs and other monsters\n- Multiple roleplay quests and characters\n- Complete quests, solve puzzles, mine and craft armors \n\nThis RPG treasure hunt adventure game includes: \n- Exploration of + 50 dungeons, medieval castles, fortresses\n- + 220 hidden objects to discover, collect, mine and craft\n- 85 crafting recipes to unlock\n- Fight + 40 different monsters \n- Free offline fantasy 2D retro game in a pixel world\n\nEnjoy Survival RPG 3: Lost in Time. Fight dragons and try to escape in this medieval exploration game!\n<b>Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/survivaladventurethegame/</b>","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $7.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QR7zoOYHdug?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1f8yEpcjhGoSBHBw14noq4PIz1y7vzNSA8OFUQZU8JNf7ZWuo_IxgtZSx57ZWZvngYL5FeOEicoeUUl6YYZthA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m0Bg5Horq3WZhhWnPJYYkULD1I_JN4WCw4Pvd02EYvLkR60ECW80vD7-1I2xB6p4sq5ZrAXp6AepNYixAoUYTQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com